{"author":{"id":"e8ccbc170af88335916e23a1b24e48c04b0a4af82e988d5245cc91e39d6a9e2c"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794491208,"nonce":"oR8tTnSMGblfRWKDMXo/6XMzxa4=","title":"L1 — tweakcn theme port to iced and ES/EN string catalogue","message":"## Context\nThe look and feel is a port of the user's tweakcn theme (tokens copied into the spec, since `docs/theme.css` is removed later). The string catalogue makes every UI text bilingual. This layer is plan Task 3 (`docs/superpowers/plans/2026-11-12-maeve.md:153`).\n\n## Files\n- `src/theme/mod.rs`, `src/theme/styles.rs` — new; export from `src/lib.rs`\n- `src/i18n.rs` — exists from core L5 with `Lang` only; add `Key` and `t()`\n- Spec token table: `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-12-maeve-design.md:112`\n\n## Approach\n- Implement plan Task 3 Interfaces: `Tokens`, `RADIUS`, `oklch()`, `tokens(dark)`, `resolve(pref, mode)`, `is_dark`, plus style fns (`button_primary`, `button_secondary`, `button_ghost`, `chip`, `card`, `input`, `text_muted`, `table_row`, `bar`)\n- Import `ThemePref` from `src/settings.rs` (core L8); do not redefine it\n- Palette mapping: background, text=foreground, primary, success=chart-1, warning=secondary, danger=destructive\n- `Key` starts with header and input strings; later layers add keys\n\n## Depends on\nCore 3bc0ebb L5 (`Lang`), L8 (`ThemePref`)\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Plan Task 3 Step 1 tests pass: white/black endpoints, `oklch(0.4341,0.0392,41.9938)` ≈ `#644a40` and `oklch(0.9247,0.0524,66.1732)` ≈ `#ffe0c2` within 2/255, `resolve` honours System vs explicit pref\n- Gates pass: `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings`, `cargo test`","files":null}]}